 Product 
 Cannon Ball 


 Roast Profile 
 Medium - Dark Roast 


 Tasting Notes 
 Floral, Sweet Almonds Toffee, Milk Chocolate, Hints of Orange 


 Intensity 





 Soft   Balanced   Strong 

 Intensity Level:(4/5) 



 Terroir &amp; Process 

 Washed Arabica - Anoxic Processed 
 Varietal -  Selection 795 
 Elevation - 1100 m.a.s.l 



 Origin 
 Zoya Coffee Estate Chikmagalur, KA, India 


 QGrader's Impression 
 "Delicate Floral Fregrance, Bold tasting notes of Almonds, Milk Chocolate. Smooth Toffee Mouthfeel with a lingering Orange citrus acidity. Balanced mouthfeel, and medium to long clean aftertaste. Become more delicate with vibrant citrus acidity as it cools"
[Meta Description]: A smooth, comforting specialty coffee with nutty and chocolaty notes. Choose whole beans or your preferred grind size for French press, pour over, AeroPress, moka pot, and more.

