 Roast Profile 
 Medium Roast 


 Tasting Notes 
 Mixed Fruits of Mulberry, Black Current, Blueberry 


 Intensity 





 Soft   Balanced   Strong 

 Intensity Level:(3/5) 



 Terroir &amp; Process 

 Naturals Arabica - Bruised Anaerobic Process 
 Varietal -  Sarchimor 
 Elevation - 1100 m.a.s.l 



 Origin 
 Boothangudi Coffee Estate 


 QGrader's Impression 
 " Very Complex fruity coffee. Flavor basket of purple berries of black current, mulberry and blueberry. Syrupy, smooth mouthfeel, crisp berry acidity with medium to long aftertaste. Imparts a juicy mouthfeel when brewed hot, as the coffee cools, becomes more mellow sweet syrupy coffee."
